American players are logging into it.

254
00:16:06,840 --> 00:16:09,257
They've been told it's a beta
for a hack and slash game,

255
00:16:09,340 --> 00:16:11,811
and they can kill anyone they come across.

256
00:16:12,340 --> 00:16:14,637
But the people of the Underworld are real.

257
00:16:14,720 --> 00:16:16,200
They're not just NPCs.

258
00:16:16,320 --> 00:16:20,200
They're true bottom-up AIs, with
feelings and souls, like us.

259
00:16:20,420 --> 00:16:23,917
We need your help to protect them,
but there's no time to level up there.

260
00:16:24,000 --> 00:16:27,137
But if you convert your character
accounts to the Underworld,

261
00:16:27,220 --> 00:16:28,720
we can save their people!

262
00:16:33,600 --> 00:16:36,760
I know you well, and I
trust your intentions.

263
00:16:37,180 --> 00:16:40,937
You wouldn't have called us so early
just so you could play a trick on us.

264
00:16:41,020 --> 00:16:44,057
And the fact Kirito hasn't
logged on for over ten

265
00:16:44,140 --> 00:16:47,940
days suggests whatever is
going on is indeed serious.

266
00:16:48,840 --> 00:16:51,080
But A .I.'s with human souls?

267
00:16:51,420 --> 00:16:52,480
And the U .S.

268
00:16:52,660 --> 00:16:54,248
military out to steal them?

269
00:16:54,380 --> 00:16:56,520
It all seems so far-fetched.

270
00:16:57,700 --> 00:17:00,406
Diving in would be the
only way to confirm it.

271
00:17:00,560 --> 00:17:01,400
In private,

272
00:17:01,720 --> 00:17:06,680
you told me you had other concerns, that
converting our accounts would have risks.

273
00:17:07,560 --> 00:17:10,560
You should explain what
those are before we decide.

274
00:17:12,620 --> 00:17:13,450
Sure.

275
00:17:13,533 --> 00:17:14,400
Here's what I know.

276
00:17:15,880 --> 00:17:18,560
The Underworld isn't a VR MMO game.

277
00:17:18,780 --> 00:17:20,297
It's a simulated civilization,

278
00:17:20,380 --> 00:17:23,660
so you'll be faced with a
few issues once you dive in.

279
00:17:24,940 --> 00:17:29,640
The first one is, there's no user
interface to call up and manipulate.

280
00:17:30,280 --> 00:17:33,320
Once you're logged in, you
can't log yourself out.

281
00:17:34,900 --> 00:17:38,360
The only way for you to log
out is by dying in there.

282
00:17:39,300 --> 00:17:42,397
That brings me to another issue
you all need to know about.

283
00:17:42,480 --> 00:17:48,957
The underworld doesn't have a pain
absorber function if you take enough

284
00:17:49,040 --> 00:17:55,360
damage to drop your HP to zero you'll
experience loads of virtual pain and

285
00:17:55,880 --> 00:17:59,777
finally the underworld's
in a chaotic state right

286
00:17:59,860 --> 00:18:03,737
now and the devs can't
fully operate it so once you

287
00:18:03,820 --> 00:18:06,997
convert your character data
to the underworld there's

288
00:18:07,080 --> 00:18:10,197
There's no guarantee you'll
be able to convert it back.

289
00:18:10,280 --> 00:18:12,020
And worse, if you die there,

290
00:18:12,260 --> 00:18:15,357
there's a good chance you might
lose your character forever.

291
00:18:15,440 --> 00:18:16,270
Did I hear?

292
00:18:16,353 --> 00:18:17,317
How did she ask that?

293
00:18:17,400 --> 00:18:18,230
Heart passed.

294
00:18:18,320 --> 00:18:19,673
Yeah, what's the point?

295
00:18:20,100 --> 00:18:21,340
What a load of crap!

296
00:18:22,200 --> 00:18:25,897
If we help them lose our characters,
are you gonna reimburse us for them?

297
00:18:25,980 --> 00:18:30,160
Or is this a trick to weaken the
tribe so you can take over? Hey!

298
00:18:30,740 --> 00:18:31,580
You're wrong.

299
00:18:31,980 --> 00:18:33,380
We're not tricking you.

300
00:18:34,740 --> 00:18:37,757
We know how hard you work
to build your characters up,

301
00:18:37,840 --> 00:18:40,546
and no amount of money
can replace their loss.

302
00:18:41,060 --> 00:18:42,825
We're not asking this lightly.

303
00:18:43,040 --> 00:18:44,746
We're begging you to help us.

304
00:18:45,240 --> 00:18:46,070
Right now,

305
00:18:46,153 --> 00:18:49,657
our friends are fighting the American
players alongside the Underworld,

306
00:18:49,740 --> 00:18:52,457
but they're outnumbered and
they need reinforcements.

307
00:18:52,540 --> 00:18:56,775
You're all SAO survivors, so you
should be tough enough to deal with it!

308
00:18:56,920 --> 00:18:58,440
Screw your sob story!

309
00:18:58,640 --> 00:19:00,857
You think you're all that just
because you were in that game?

310
00:19:00,940 --> 00:19:03,937
Well, here's your chance to
prove how badass you are!

311
00:19:04,020 --> 00:19:07,160
Why should we care about
hijackers or AIs with souls?

312
00:19:07,480 --> 00:19:11,480
Don't bring this real-life crap
into our game and expect us to help!

313
00:19:11,580 --> 00:19:14,437
You and the rest of your
SAO club can deal with it!

314
00:19:14,520 --> 00:19:17,360
Go save the day again, you stuck-up jerks!

315
00:19:25,480 --> 00:19:26,597
It didn't work.

316
00:19:26,680 --> 00:19:29,060
No matter what I say, I don't care.

317
00:19:59,400 --> 00:20:00,837
You're right.

318
00:20:00,920 --> 00:20:06,297
this is a real-life problem
and as for us survivors

319
00:20:06,380 --> 00:20:10,117
yeah some of us do blur the
line between the real world and

320
00:20:10,200 --> 00:20:14,277
the virtual but we don't
think we're tougher or better

321
00:20:14,360 --> 00:20:19,020
than anyone here none of us
think we're heroes me and Silica

322
00:20:19,700 --> 00:20:23,937
she and I go to a special school for
survivors once a month the students

323
00:20:24,020 --> 00:20:29,740
have to go to counseling because of the
trauma we still deal with they ask us

324
00:20:30,300 --> 00:20:31,337
painful questions.

325
00:20:31,420 --> 00:20:35,377
They make some of the kids take
medication, even though it makes them

326
00:20:35,460 --> 00:20:36,290
sick.

327
00:20:36,373 --> 00:20:37,203
And the government?

328
00:20:37,420 --> 00:20:40,891
They're afraid of us, so they
monitor us like we're a bunch

329
00:20:41,300 --> 00:20:42,130
of criminals.

330
00:20:42,213 --> 00:20:46,400
The truth is, it's not just us at the
returnee school they're suspicious

331
00:20:48,640 --> 00:20:49,470
of.

332
00:20:49,553 --> 00:20:51,200
It's all VR MMO players.

333
00:20:51,540 --> 00:20:53,897
They think we're all a bunch of deadbeats.

334
00:20:53,980 --> 00:20:55,640
Losers dragging society

335
00:20:57,660 --> 00:20:58,490
down.

336
00:20:58,573 --> 00:21:00,857
Cowards who don't pay taxes
and can't face reality.

337
00:21:00,940 --> 00:21:04,157
People are saying we need
the draft back to force

338
00:21:04,240 --> 00:21:06,737
us to enlist because at
least we can be useful there.

339
00:21:06,820 --> 00:21:08,644
And even though they think that

340
00:21:11,080 --> 00:21:13,080
about us, you know what I believe?

341
00:21:13,300 --> 00:21:16,657
That this here, this is reality.

342
00:21:16,740 --> 00:21:20,657
This world and all the other
Virtual worlds connected

343
00:21:20,740 --> 00:21:25,537
to it they're real they're
not just games we play here

344
00:21:25,620 --> 00:21:30,557
in VR I have a real life and
I have real friends I laugh

345
00:21:30,640 --> 00:21:33,816
and I cry and I feel real
feelings the same as offline

346
00:21:34,540 --> 00:21:38,017
isn't it like that for you we
pour our hearts and souls into

347
00:21:38,100 --> 00:21:42,177
this world because it's different
from what we got out there but

348
00:21:42,260 --> 00:21:45,677
if it's all just a stupid game
everything we've been through

349
00:21:45,760 --> 00:21:51,700
and felt here is fake if so then
in the end what is real for us

350
00:21:54,820 --> 00:21:57,257
all the worlds we've grown fused together

351
00:21:57,340 --> 00:22:00,240
they're as thick and
tall as the world tree

352
00:22:00,900 --> 00:22:04,457
and from them from them the underworld

353
00:22:04,540 --> 00:22:10,120
started to bloom I want
to protect it so please

354
00:22:10,640 --> 00:22:14,280
Please, please, help us.

355
00:22:51,540 --> 00:22:52,440
Don't stop!

356
00:22:52,680 --> 00:22:53,680
Cut the next one!

357
00:23:17,680 --> 00:23:20,477
We'll see you

358
00:23:20,560 --> 00:23:27,560
next

359
00:23:36,440 --> 00:23:37,270
time.
